cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QPlayer, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "QPlayer: a high-performance quantum circuit emulator"
abstract: >-
  QPlayer is a C++17 quantum circuit emulator with Python bindings. It accepts
  OpenQASM 2.0, a C++ API and a Python API, lowers them to a common circuit IR,
  and executes on FullState (CPU/GPU), SparseState and TensorNetwork (MPS)
  backends, with noise models, device models, interactive execution and
  coupling-map compilation.
